{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02761","headline":"咏史四首 二 · 卢照邻","name":"咏史四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大汉昔云季，小人道遂振。\n玉帛委奄尹，斧鑕婴缙绅。\n邈哉郭先生，卷舒得其真。\n雍容谢朝廷，谈笑奖人伦。\n在晦不绝俗，处乱不爲亲。\n诸侯不得友，天子不得臣。\n冲情甄负甑，重价折角巾。\n悠悠天下士，相送洛桥津。\n谁知仙舟上寂寂无四邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}